From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Taylor <zctaylor.work@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:29:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 22/30] Expose a consistent public supervisor activation
 observation

kubectl ate get supervisor-activation reads the actor, its template and
the actor again, and prints the public activation identity as JSON only
when all three reads agree. A caller can then compare the running
activation with its own records without seeing environment values or
any token.

Fork-Topic: fabriek-bootstrap
Fork-Upstream: fork-only
